1. Does replaying the firmware's event log give the PCR values the TPM holds?
   fw_empty     PCR 0-7 replayed = PCR 0-7 in the TPM: yes, all eight
   fw_enrolled  PCR 0-7 replayed = PCR 0-7 in the TPM: yes, all eight
   fw_rotated   PCR 0-7 replayed = PCR 0-7 in the TPM: yes, all eight
